# =============================================================================
# PII redaction — .gitignore
# Defensive by design: customer data, model artifacts, logs, and experiment
# archives are never committed. When in doubt, a path is excluded here.
# =============================================================================

# --- Python ---
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# =============================================================================
# CUSTOMER DATA AND ANYTHING DERIVED FROM IT — never commit (real PII,
# including in file names)
# =============================================================================
# Everything under data/ is offline (real PII, including in file names): the
# source transcripts (data/train/, data/val/), the built train.jsonl/val.jsonl,
# and the frozen test gold (data/test/). Only ONE fake example.json per split
# folder is committed so the model input/output shape stays visible in git.
data/*
!data/train/
!data/val/
!data/test/
data/train/*
!data/train/example.json
data/val/*
!data/val/example.json
data/test/*
!data/test/example.json
# Legacy split folders, superseded by data/train, data/val, data/test. They may
# still hold offline real-PII .jsonl locally; never track them.
/training_data/
/val_data/
/test_data/
# Training and run logs.
**/logs/
*.log

# --- Generated benchmark artifacts ---
# Only the frozen comparison metric table is tracked. Everything else under
# results/ (HTML reports and failure dumps that contain real PII, judge
# outputs, chunked-experiment tables) stays local.
evaluation/results/*
!evaluation/results/frozen_comparison.txt

# Experiment archive (includes PII data backups).
archive/
# Planning notes that still contain transcript excerpts; scrub before committing.
FULL_CONTEXT.md
FINETUNE_9LABEL_PLAN.md

# =============================================================================
# MODEL ARTIFACTS — keep the fine-tuned keeper adapter (~13 MB) and the
# rule-based baseline; exclude intermediate checkpoints and superseded runs.
# The base model downloads from Hugging Face at runtime.
# =============================================================================
models/*
!models/finetuned_pii_9label/
!models/rule-based-gliner/
models/finetuned_pii_9label/*
!models/finetuned_pii_9label/best/

# --- Notebooks (saved cell outputs can contain real transcripts) ---
*.ipynb
# Exception: reproducible leak-judge notebook — no outputs, synthetic examples only.
!evaluation/leak_tests/residual_pii_analysis.ipynb
# Exception: synthetic-data generator notebook — no outputs, synthetic scenarios only.
!finetuning/data_prep/generate_synthetic_data.ipynb

# --- external/ is not part of the handover repo ---
# The company's own presidio-gliner checkout and any experimental work left
# under external/ locally is never tracked.
external/

# --- Scrubbed investigation write-up: still being drafted, kept offline ---
DOCUMENT.md

# =============================================================================
# Experimental: chunked-training runs (a tested dead end). Kept locally for
# reference but not committed.
# =============================================================================
CHUNKED_MODEL.md
finetuning/data_prep/build_chunked_training_data.py
finetuning/scripts/train_chunked.py
finetuning/scripts/train_chunked_ctx.py
